WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:03.733
The free fine-tune deletes the confidence head.

00:00:03.733 --> 00:00:04.763
Cactus says so.

00:00:04.763 --> 00:00:07.166
What it costs, read from the weights.

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:11.884
The guide, from Cactus: Local fine-tuning does not train it, so needle

00:00:11.884 --> 00:00:14.121
build leaves it out of the archive.

00:00:14.121 --> 00:00:14.760
It holds.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:23.015
71,077 parameters in the confidence head: six tensors, read from the shipped safetensors.

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:29.885
The 20-layer archive, computed from the shipped file's own records.

00:00:29.885 --> 00:00:35.720
The shipped file, 35.34 MB; tuned locally, 4-bit, 63.44 MB.

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:37.470
That is 1.80x.

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:40.148
The local path is real.

00:00:40.148 --> 00:00:43.344
It ships no confidence head, at nearly twice the size.

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:50.608
Every number here is from the full article, with its sources, at ai.thesatyajit.com.
